cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use laman in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "laman: a deterministic 2D geometric constraint solver in pure Rust"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sergienko
    given-names: Sergei
repository-code: "https://github.com/arris-labs/laman"
url: "https://github.com/arris-labs/laman"
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  laman is a 2D geometric constraint solver written in pure Rust, for Rust
  and Python: points, lines, circles and arcs under geometric and
  dimensional constraints, a damped least-squares solve, and diagnostics
  that give the exact remaining degrees of freedom and name the redundant
  and conflicting constraints. Every solve is deterministic across
  platforms and checked by an independent verifier.
keywords:
  - geometric constraint solving
  - CAD
  - sketch
  - rigidity
  - Laman's theorem
  - Rust
